answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Mon + Tue + Wed = 3 × 38 = 114.\n• Tue + Wed + Thu = 3 × 40 = 120.\n• Subtracting: Thu - Mon = 120 - 114 = 6 => Mon = Thu - 6 = 42 - 6 = 36°C."
