exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Sunlight triggers a photochemical decomposition reaction: $2\\text{AgCl} \\xrightarrow{\\text{sunlight}} 2\\text{Ag} + \\text{Cl}_2$, leaving grey metallic silver."
