options: ["A) All cranial and spinal nerves branching out from the CNS (कपाल और मेरुरज्जु तंत्रिकाएं)", "B) Brain and spinal cord", "C) Cerebrum and Cerebellum", "D) Hypothalamus and Pituitary"],
