options: ["A) Because energy lost as heat cannot be reused by plants\n(क्योंकि ऊष्मा के रूप में नष्ट हुई ऊर्जा को पौधे दोबारा उपयोग नहीं कर सकते)", "B) Because sun energy flows backward", "C) Due to gravity", "D) Because consumers produce solar energy"],
