options: ["A) Preserving seeds, gametes, and embryos at ultra-low temperatures (liquid nitrogen)\n(-196°C तरल नाइट्रोजन में बीज और युग्मक सुरक्षित रखना)", "B) Growing plants in dark greenhouses", "C) Breeding animals in open zoo enclosures", "D) Purifying polluted lake water"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• **Cryopreservation** involves storing seeds, embryos, or tissues at ultra-low temperatures (using liquid nitrogen at -196°C) for long-term genetic conservation."
