answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• The six orthodox schools (*Shad-Darshana*) accepting Vedic authority are **Nyaya** (logic), **Vaisheshika** (atomism), **Samkhya** (dualism), **Yoga** (meditation), **Mimansa** (ritualism), and **Vedanta** (ultimate reality)."
