q: "Q30. What is the critical importance of soil health management for India's agricultural sustainability?\nभारत की कृषि स्थिरता के लिए मिट्टी के स्वास्थ्य का प्रबंधन क्यों अत्यंत महत्वपूर्ण है?\n",
options: ["A) Ensures long-term food security, prevents land degradation, and sustains high crop yields without chemical exhaustion\n(दीर्घकालिक खाद्य सुरक्षा सुनिश्चित करना, भूमि क्षरण रोकना और रासायनिक उर्वरकों के बिना उच्च पैदावार बनाए रखना)", "B) Turns all farm lands into rocky deserts", "C) Eliminates the need for irrigation permanently", "D) Replaces seeds with plastic fertilizers"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Maintaining soil health through balanced fertilization, organic manure, and erosion control is vital for sustaining India's long-term agricultural productivity and food security."
