options: ["A) Ring of Fire / पैसिफिक रिंग ऑफ फायर (अग्नि वलय)", "B) Alpine-Himalayan Belt", "C) Mid-Atlantic Ridge", "D) Circum-Indian Seismic Zone"],
answer: 0,
