exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Due to the vast open oceans in the Southern Hemisphere, westerlies blow fiercely, known famously as the **Roaring Forties** (40°S), Furious Fifties (50°S), and Shrieking Sixties (60°S)."
