q: "Q28. What is the primary driving force behind surface ocean currents across the globe?\nदुनिया भर में सतही महासागरीय धाराओं (Surface ocean currents) के प्रवाह के पीछे मुख्य प्राथमिक बल कौन सा है?",
options: ["A) Planetary surface winds (Prevailing winds like trades and westerlies) alongside Coriolis force\n(प्रचलित पवनें और कोरिऑलिस बल)", "B) Earth's magnetic pole attraction", "C) Melting glaciers exclusively", "D) Tidal friction from the moon"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Surface ocean currents are driven primarily by **prevailing surface winds** (trade winds, westerlies) acting in conjunction with Earth's rotation and the Coriolis effect."
