q: "Q5. Why is the Rajya Sabha referred to as a 'Permanent Body' (House that never dies)?\nराज्यसभा को एक 'स्थायी सदन' (कभी भंग न होने वाला सदन) क्यों कहा जाता है?",
options: ["A) Because it is not subject to dissolution, with one-third of its members retiring every second year\n(क्योंकि यह कभी भंग नहीं होती और इसके एक-तिहाई सदस्य हर दूसरे वर्ष सेवानिवृत्त होते हैं)", "B) Because its members serve a lifetime tenure", "C) Because it has more power than the Lok Sabha", "D) Because it is elected directly by citizens for 10 years"],
answer: 0,
