q: "Q30. What is the overarching democratic role of the State Government machinery in India?\nभारत में राज्य सरकार की मशीनरी की समग्र लोकतांत्रिक भूमिका क्या है?\n",
options: ["A) Implements localized public policies, maintains law and order, drives regional development, and delivers grassroots welfare to citizens\n(स्थानीय नीतियों का क्रियान्वयन, कानून-व्यवस्था, क्षेत्रीय विकास और नागरिकों तक जमीनी कल्याण पहुँचाना)", "B) Manages international defense pacts with foreign nations", "C) Regulates national currency printing and foreign exchange", "D) Operates solely as an advisory committee for Supreme Court judges"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• State governments serve as the foundational bedrock of Indian federalism, tailoring grassroots governance, public welfare, and development to diverse regional needs."
