options: ["A) Constitutional division of tax powers, resource allocation, and revenue sharing via Finance Commission mechanisms\n(कर लगाने की शक्तियों का संवैधानिक विभाजन, संसाधन आवंटन और वित्त आयोग के माध्यम से राजस्व साझाकरण)", "B) Total centralization of all money in the Prime Minister's office", "C) States levying taxes on international trade freely", "D) Abolition of all income taxes nationwide"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Fiscal federalism governs the constitutional division of taxation powers and revenue sharing (via GST Council and Finance Commission) to balance vertical and horizontal fiscal imbalances."
