options: ["A) Mayor (महापौर) as political head, and Municipal Commissioner as administrative executive head\n(राजनीतिक प्रमुख - महापौर / मेयर, और प्रशासनिक प्रमुख - नगर आयुक्त / कमिश्नर)", "B) Governor of the City", "C) District Collector", "D) Chief Minister"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• In a Municipal Corporation, the **Mayor** is elected as the ceremonial political head, while the **Municipal Commissioner** (appointed by the state government) heads the executive machinery."
