q: "Q30. What is the overarching macroeconomic significance of the Budget and Fiscal Policy in India's development?\nभारत के विकास में केंद्रीय बजट और राजकोषीय नीति का समग्र समष्टि आर्थिक महत्व क्या है?\n",
options: ["A) Serve as the primary instruments for resource mobilization, poverty reduction, infrastructural growth, and macroeconomic stability\n(संसाधन जुटाने, गरीबी घटाने, बुनियादी ढांचे के विकास और आर्थिक स्थिरता के मुख्य साधन)", "B) Act as corporate stock trading exchange platforms", "C) Function as judicial courts for tax fraud prosecution", "D) Serve as fixed foreign currency exchange rate guarantees"],
