q: "Q23. What is 'Culture' (संस्कृति) defined as in sociological and anthropological studies?\nसमाजशास्त्र और मानवविज्ञान में 'संस्कृति' (Culture) के अंतर्गत क्या शामिल होता है?",
options: ["A) The shared beliefs, values, customs, language, art, and artifacts that characterize a group or society\n(किसी समाज के लोगों द्वारा साझा किए जाने वाले विश्वास, मूल्य, रीति-रिवाज, भाषा और जीवनशैली)", "B) Purely biological genetic inheritance from parents", "C) Total gold currency reserves in central bank vaults", "D) Military defense weaponry inventories"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• **Culture** encompasses the total way of life of a society, including shared values, beliefs, norms, material objects, language, and symbolic behaviors passed across generations."
