q: "Q21. What is 'Context Switching' in operating system process execution?\nऑपरेटिंग सिस्टम में 'कंटेक्स्ट स्विचिंग' (Context Switching) का क्या अर्थ है?\n",
options: ["A) Storing the state of a currently running process and restoring the state of another waiting process for CPU execution\n(एक प्रक्रिया की स्थिति को सुरक्षित रखकर दूसरी प्रक्रिया को CPU का नियंत्रण देना)", "B) Changing desktop wallpaper backgrounds automatically", "C) Switching internet browser tabs in Chrome", "D) Changing computer keyboard language layout"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• **Context switching** is the procedure where the CPU stores the state (context) of a running process so it can be resumed later, and loads state for another process."
