q: "Q7. What is the function of a 'Modem' in internet connectivity?\nइंटरनेट कनेक्टिविटी में 'मॉडेम' (Modem) का मुख्य कार्य क्या होता है?",
options: ["A) Modulates digital signals into analog for transmission over telephone lines and demodulates analog back to digital\n(डिजिटल सिग्नलों को एनालॉग में बदलना और एनालॉग को वापस डिजिटल में बदलना - Modulator-Demodulator)", "B) Amplifies Wi-Fi wireless radio signals across walls", "C) Stores backup files on cloud servers", "D) Translates high-level programming source code into machine binary"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• **Modem** (Modulator-Demodulator) converts digital data from a computer into analog signals for transmission over telephone/cable lines, and vice versa."
