options: ["A) Relational Database Management System (रैशनल डेटाबेस मैनेजमेंट सिस्टम)", "B) Remote Data Backup Management Service", "C) Rapid Digital Business Multitasking System", "D) Reliable Data Binary Monitoring Station"],
answer: 0,
