q: "Q15. What are the primary sub-languages into which SQL commands are categorized?\nSQL कमांड को मुख्य रूप से किन प्रमुख श्रेणियों (Sub-languages) में विभाजित किया जाता है?",
options: ["A) DDL, DML, DCL, and TCL (Data Definition, Data Manipulation, Data Control, Transaction Control)", "B) CPU, RAM, ROM, and ALU", "C) HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP", "D) LAN, WAN, IP, and DNS"],
