q: "Q8. Choose the correct meaning of the idiom: **'Elephant in the room'**\nदिए गए मुहावरे **'Elephant in the room'** का सबसे सटीक अर्थ चुनें:",
options: ["A) An obvious major problem or controversial issue that people avoid discussing because it is embarrassing\n(एक बहुत बड़ी समस्या या मुद्दा जिसके बारे में सब जानते हैं लेकिन कोई बात नहीं करना चाहता)", "B) A wild animal kept inside a small apartment", "C) A decorated statue in a living room", "D) A secret surprise birthday party"],
