q: "Q10. Choose the correct verb tense: 'If it rains, we ________ at home.'\nConditional sentences (Type 1) के लिए सही क्रिया चुनें: 'If it rains, we ________ at home.'",
options: ["A) will stay / (शर्त वाले वाक्य के पहले भाग में Present Simple और दूसरे में Future Simple आता है)", "B) stayed", "C) would stay", "D) stay"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• In a first conditional sentence, the 'if' clause uses Present Simple ('rains'), and the main clause uses **Future Simple ('will stay')**."
