options: ["A) were / (काल्पनिक इच्छा के लिए 'if I were')", "B) was", "C) am", "D) have been"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• In hypothetical second conditional sentences expressing unreal present states, **'were'** is used with all subjects (e.g., 'If I were a bird...')."
