q: "Q21. Find the part with an error in the sentence: **'He is senior / than me / in age and experience.' / (No error)**\nदिए गए वाक्य में त्रुटि वाला भाग पहचानिए:",
options: ["A) than me (यहाँ 'than' की जगह 'to' और 'me' की जगह 'me/objective case' पर 'to me' होगा)", "B) He is senior", "C) in age and experience", "D) No error"],
answer: 0,
exp: "Explanation / स्पष्टीकरण:\n• Rule: Latin comparative adjectives ending in **-or** (*senior, junior, superior, inferior, prior*) take the preposition **'to'** instead of 'than'. Change 'than me' to **'to me'**."
